---
title: Dark skins, 3D portraits and a feeds page
date: 2026-09-13
summary: The site picked up skins named after CS:GO finishes, 3D portraits and one page for everything I post.
art: skins
---

This was a big week for the look of the site.

- **Skins.** Asiimov orange, Vulcan cyan, plus two dark ones: Manticore and Donatello. You pick one and the whole site changes.
- **3D portraits.** Models in a small bay, compressed so they load fast.
- **Feeds.** YouTube, Medium, Instagram and LinkedIn, all on one page.
- **App identities.** Upstreams, Fiend and DroneWashers each got their own colour, wordmark and motif.

Also behind the scenes: privacy-first analytics that stays off until you say yes.
